Z||000013||DaRkLoRD||11-28-2001||09:16 PM||||You know what they say... all good things must come to an end.....  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>I have to part out my Fiero. I can't afford to fix it.<P>**sigh**<P>on the bright side, I get the experience of dismantling a fiero, and the knowledge that the profit will go towards the next one.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I'll be posting something in the mall in a couple of days, after I talk to some people.<P>------------------<BR>    <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>    <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||9
